    "case_for": "GLP-1 physiology joins a fundamental account of nutrient-regulated endocrine signaling to a major and durable therapeutic advance in diabetes and obesity. The supplied evidence supports mature biological rationale, extensive clinical confirmation, and unusually broad public-health significance. Holst, Mojsov, and Drucker form a plausible three-person allocation across foundational physiology, molecular characterization, and translational development.",
